details = "We got an anonymous tip some foreigner with a smooth accent has been snooping around.  That's all above board, but Louie caught him on the 25th swapping his license plates.  We didn't have a reason to write down his old plates, but now we need you to figure out the new one so we can cite the son-of-a-bitch."
